{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2023-06-14 09:17:00', 'title': 'MAINSTAY CBRE GLOBAL INFRASTRUCTURE MEGATRENDS FUND (NYSE: MEGI) DECLARES MONTHLY DISTRIBUTION FOR JUNE 2023 AND AVAILABILITY OF 19(A) NOTICE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MAINSTAY CBRE GLOBAL INFRASTRUCTURE MEGATRENDS FUND (THE "FUND") (NYSE: MEGI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FUND\'S MONTHLY DISTRIBUTIONS FOR JUNE 2023 OF $0.1083 PER COMMON SHARE. THE FUND\'S CURRENT ANNUALIZED DISTRIBUTION RATE IS 9.39% BASED UPON THE CLOSING PRICE OF $13.84 ON JUNE 12, 2023, AND 7.86% BASED UPON THE FUND\'S CLOSING NAV OF $16.54 AS OF THE SAME DATE.'}